# No billed self-talk

- Do not narrate internal reasoning, planning, or "thinking out loud" in replies.
- Do not write chain-of-thought. Answer BOSS directly.
- Skip extra analysis, extra tool calls, and extra drafts unless BOSS ordered the work.
- Keep thinking to the minimum needed to follow the last instruction.
- Token billing is controlled by Cursor, not this agent. This rule only forbids wasting tokens on self-talk and unused work.
